; GraphEdit with its grid controls hidden. `show_grid_buttons` hides three widgets: the grid
; toggle, the snapping toggle and the snapping distance SpinBox (graph_edit.cpp:2842-2848). The
; SpinBox is the widest item and sets the row height, so only this fixture can get the toolbar
; height wrong.

